    skos:scopeNote "Document-attested minor 19th-century commodity absent as a standalone line in Layer-1 British/Canadian customs ledgers; typically subsumed under htc:0122 (Drugs Unenumerated). Attested in: Danika Drugs.xlsx (British Pharmacopoeia 1867 / Savory 1865), P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 74, Thomas Mortimer (rev. Dickinson), A General Commercial Dictionary (1823), scan p. 194."@en ;
